            { type = "p", text = "Ensemble: Midnight OutlawTransmog Head x3, Chest, Shirt, Shoulders, Cloak/Back, Waist, Hands, Legs x2, Feet x2\"I’m walkin’ here!\"" },
            { type = "p", text = "Complete activities to fill the bar at the top of the Traveler’s Log found in the Adventure Guide (Shift-J)***, and you'll receive this month's bonus reward—the Ensemble: Midnight Outlaw transmog. Add this striking new look to your collection and walk tall wherever you go." },
            { type = "hr" },
            { type = "h2", text = "HOW IT WORKS" },
            { type = "h3", text = "Get Tender Every Month" },
            { type = "p", text = "At the beginning of each month, players with an active account in good standing will receive 500 Trader’s Tender automatically every month from a chest called the Collector’s Cache. If you don’t have active game time on your account or aren’t a subscriber at the start of a new month, don’t worry. Your Tender will be awarded on the first day of the month when you do have game time or an active subscription. This will be the same amount for everyone, regardless of how you pay for your game time." },
            { type = "h3", text = "The Traveler's Log" },
            { type = "p", text = "Complete monthly activities listed in the new Traveler’s Log. Each month features a rotating, themed set of activities. These activities provide the opportunity to earn up to 500 additional Trader’s Tender. There’s only a set amount of Tender you can earn each month through completing activities, so you won’t need to complete all the ones in the log each month. You’ll be able to pick and choose from a variety of fun in-game activities to easily earn Tender. Players can choose to earn by continuing to play the game as they already do, such as completing quests, competing in battlegrounds, participating in holiday activities, and even running Mythic+ dungeons. But you can also choose to take part in activities uniquely designed for the month." },
            { type = "h3", text = "Freeze an Item" },
            { type = "p", text = "Before the month comes to an end, if you haven’t purchased that one “must-have” item yet, don’t worry. You can “freeze” an item so you can purchase it later. When you freeze an item, it will stay available month over month until it is purchased or replaced." },
            { type = "p", text = "If this month’s offerings didn’t have the items you wanted, you can hang on to your Trader’s Tender to spend later. It won’t go anywhere, and unspent Tender will continue to accumulate each month." },
            { type = "hr" },
            { type = "p", text = "Learn more about the Trading Post from the news post on the official site." },
            { type = "p", text = "*The Trading Post feature is not available in WoW Classic titles.**Requires World of Warcraft Subscription or Game Time***Requires Level 10 to access the Adventure Guide." },
            },
        },
        ["2026-08-08-craft-new-adventures-with-dd-world-of-warcraft-b1aaebbc96"] = {
            id = "2026-08-08-craft-new-adventures-with-dd-world-of-warcraft-b1aaebbc96",
            post_key = "b1aaebbc96",
            title = "Craft New Adventures with D&D: World of Warcraft",
            category = "Blogs (US)",
            timestamp = 1786185475,
            url = "https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24293053/craft-new-adventures-with-d-d-world-of-warcraft",
            content = {
            { type = "p", text = "Warm up your dice, Azeroth sets a new stage in Dungeons & Dragons!" },
            { type = "p", text = "Releasing November 17 with early access beginning November 3, D&D: World of Warcraft® brings the storied MMO world from desktop to tabletop, handing players and Dungeon Masters everything they need to set their next great campaign. Get ready to choose your faction, build your champion, and carve out your own legacy. Pre-purchase D&D: World of Warcraft Bundles for an epic haul of treasures to start your adventures off on the right path including World of Warcraft in-game items: Black Dragon Mount, Gazer pet, Mimic Chest toy, Mimic Chest decor." },
            { type = "p", text = "PRE-ORDER NOW" },
            { type = "hr" },
            { type = "h2", text = "CLAIM EPIC LOOT WITH THE D&D: WORLD OF WARCRAFT COLLECTOR’S EDITION ULTIMATE BUNDLE" },
            { type = "p", text = "The rarest drop of all! Bring the legendary world of Azeroth to your table with the D&D: World of Warcraft Collector's Edition Ultimate Bundle —a limited-run treasure for collectors chasing legendary loot." },
            { type = "p", text = "Get the complete Azeroth campaign experience—the limited-edition Collector's Edition in a foil-and-sculpted slipcase, the Icecrown Citadel Map Pack and Digital Adventure, the D&D: World of Warcraft Dungeon Master’s Screen, and a guaranteed Murloc Promo Mini—in one bundle in physical and digital—plus more digital pre-order rewards, including a code for World of Warcraft in-game items*" },
            { type = "hr" },
            { type = "h2", text = "DISCOVER THE COMPLETE GAMEPLAY EXPANSION" },
            { type = "p", text = "Azeroth is calling, and this time, the story is yours to tell. D&D: World of Warcraft invites you to bring the legends, factions, and iconic adventures of World of Warcraft to your own campaign table, where your choices shape every battle, every alliance, and every legend. Recreate your main player character, roll a new alt, or play a hero the world has never seen." },
            { type = "h3", text = "Six New Subclasses and Thirteen Class Skins" },
            { type = "p", text = "D&D: World of Warcraft brings the fantasy of all thirteen World of Warcraft classes to the tabletop. Each class builds on a foundation from the Player's Handbook, then layers on alterations, new options, and guidance inspired by their World of Warcraft specializations." },
            { type = "p", text = "The book adds six new subclasses: the Oath of the Ebon Blade and Oath of the Holy Paladin, the Demon Hunter Ranger, the Shadow Domain and Discipline Domain Cleric, and the Path of the Elements Barbarian." },
            { type = "p", text = "Rounding out the roster are three updated subclasses (Swashbuckler Rogue, Path of the Spiritual Guardian Barbarian, and Warrior of Mystic Brews Monk)." },
            { type = "h3", text = "Sixteen Species Straight From Azeroth" },
            { type = "p", text = "In addition to new WoW-mapping rules for five existing species, D&D: World of Warcraft adds eleven new species —Dracthyr, Draenei, Earthen, Forsaken, Haranir, Mechagnome, Pandaren, Tauren, Troll, Vulpera, and Worgen—to help you build a character that feels unmistakably World of Warcraft." },
            { type = "p", text = "From Azeroth's ancient races to newcomers from distant realms, these species bring a wide range of histories, cultures, and perspectives to your adventures. Your choice of species can even grant a starting Renown Score with one of Azeroth's factions—so whether you ride out “For the Horde!” or “For the Alliance!”, your allegiance is baked into your origin." },
            { type = "h3", text = "Sixty Spells, Twenty-Five Magic Items, and Ten Plus Professions" },
            { type = "p", text = "D&D: World of Warcraft contains 60+ new spells to equip your champion with their signature abilities, including well-known spells like Rune Strike, Demon Spikes, Moonfire, and more!" },
            { type = "p", text = "Every adventure deserves a reward! This book contains a treasure haul of popular magic items, mounts, and companion creatures to reward your exploration across Azeroth." },
            { type = "p", text = "And questing is only half the story: choose from over ten professions to customize your hero between quests, turning downtime into a space to craft gear, tinker on trinkets, and prep upgrades." },
            { type = "h3", text = "Fifty Monsters and Thirty Dungeon Bosses" },
            { type = "p", text = "Face Azeroth's greatest threats with 50+ new monsters and 30 dungeon boss stat blocks built for the climactic encounter peaks your party won't stop talking about." },
            { type = "p", text = "From mysterious allies to legendary foes, your campaign will never be lacking for the creatures that make Azeroth unforgettable." },
            { type = "h3", text = "Seven Iconic Dungeons Reimagined" },
            { type = "p", text = "Revisit your favorite encounters in Azeroth with seven iconic World of Warcraft dungeons rebuilt for tabletop play." },
            { type = "p", text = "Each one is packed with boss encounters worthy of the legends — whether you're exploring a dungeon you’ve never tried before or diving into a fan-favorite you know by heart." },
            { type = "list_item", text = "Azjol-Nerub", level = 0 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "Blackfathom Deeps", level = 0 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "Deadmines", level = 0 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "Dire Maul", level = 0 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "Onyxia's Lair", level = 0 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "Scarlet Monastery", level = 0 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "Shadowfang Keep", level = 0 },
            { type = "h3", text = "Twenty-Five Factions to Fortify Your Legacy" },
            { type = "p", text = "D&D: World of Warcraft introduces 20+ factions, each with its own renown rewards for securing your legacy across Azeroth." },
            { type = "p", text = "Built on the renown rules from the Dungeon Master's Guide, each faction tracks your reputation and pays out tangible and intangible rewards as it grows—new allies, safe passage through hostile territory, and perks reserved for those who've earned their trust." },
            { type = "p", text = "Grind your rep with a smaller group for a quick favor, or pledge to one banner and rally to your chosen cause." },
            { type = "hr" },
            { type = "h2", text = "BUILD YOUR AZEROTH ARSENAL" },
            { type = "h3", text = "D&D: World of Warcraft — Icecrown Citadel Map Pack and Digital Adventure" },
            { type = "p", text = "The Lich King's stronghold awaits. Bring one of Azeroth's most iconic raids to your table with five double-sided poster maps and a complete digital adventure that carries your party from the Lower Spire to the Frozen Throne." },
            { type = "list_item", text = "5 double-sided poster maps (22\"×30\") covering 10 of Icecrown Citadel's most iconic encounters", level = 0 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "2 token sheets to populate your encounters with the Lich King's forces", level = 0 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "Full digital adventure spanning levels 16-20 across 5 chapters, 10 maps, and 10 boss encounters", level = 0 },
            { type = "p", text = "Sixteen new magic items interwoven throughout the adventure including Frostmourne, Invincible, Bone Warden’s Splitter, and more." },
            { type = "h3", text = "D&D: World of Warcraft Dungeon Master's Screen" },
            { type = "p", text = "The secret lore of Azeroth is yours to keep hidden behind the physical, double-sided D&D: World of Warcraft Dungeon Master's Screen." },
            { type = "list_item", text = "Four-panel physical screen designed for Azeroth campaigns", level = 0 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "Player-facing side featuring sweeping World of Warcraft artwork that sets the tone before a single die hits the table", level = 0 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "DM-facing reference keeping faction renown, and combat for quick reference", level = 0 },
            { type = "hr" },
            { type = "h2", text = "FAQ" },
            { type = "h3", text = "What comes in the D&D: World of Warcraft Ultimate Bundle?" },
            { type = "p", text = "The D&D: World of Warcraft Ultimate Bundle gives you the complete Azeroth experience in physical and digital: the core D&D: World of Warcraft gameplay expansion, the Icecrown Citadel Map Pack and Digital Adventure, the D&D: World of Warcraft Dungeon Master's Screen, a Murloc Promo Mini (while supplies last), and the digital pre-order bonuses—including a code for World of Warcraft in-game items* (requires Battle.net account)—all while saving you money if purchased them individually." },
            { type = "h3", text = "What comes in the D&D: World of Warcraft Collector's Edition Ultimate Bundle?" },
            { type = "p", text = "Are you searching for legendary loot? The D&D: World of Warcraft Collector's Edition Ultimate Bundle swaps the traditional cover book with a limited-print physical Collector's Edition—a slipcase presentation with foil and sculpted cover treatments dedicated to two of World of Warcraft's iconic factions—alongside the digital expansion, the Icecrown Citadel Map Pack & Digital Adventure, the D&D: World of Warcraft Dungeon Master's Screen, and pre-order bonuses (including a guaranteed Murloc Promo Mini miniature, a code for World of Warcraft in-game items* (requires Battle.net account), and more)." },
            { type = "h3", text = "What are the digital pre-order bonuses?" },
            { type = "p", text = "Pre-ordering the D&D: World of Warcraft Ultimate Bundle or Collector’s Edition Bundle unlocks the Icy Throne Digital Dice Set, Horde & Alliance Character Sheet Backgrounds & Frames, the Dungeon Masters: World of Warcraft Play-Along Pack, a D&D Encounters: Season of Champions mini-adventure, a Murloc Promo Mini (guaranteed with the Collector’s Edition Bundle), and a code for World of Warcraft in-game items delivered via email (requires a Battle.net account)." },
            { type = "h3", text = "What character options are included?" },
            { type = "p", text = "D&D: World of Warcraft includes the following player options:" },
            { type = "list_item", text = "Rules for playing all 13 World of Warcraft subclasses:", level = 0 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "6 new subclasses: Oath of the Ebon Blade and Oath of the Holy (Paladin), Demon Hunter (Ranger), Shadow Domain and Discipline Domain (Cleric), and Path of the Elements (Barbarian)", level = 1 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "3 updated subclasses: Swashbuckler (Rogue), Path of the Spiritual Guardian (Barbarian), and Warrior of Mystic Brews (Monk)", level = 1 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "Over 40 specializations", level = 1 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "16 species", level = 0 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "11 New: Dracthyr, Draenei, Earthen, Forsaken, Haranir, Mechagnome, Pandaren, Tauren, Troll, Vulpera, and Worgen", level = 1 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "5 Revised: Dwarf, Elf, Goblin, Human, Orc", level = 1 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "60+ new spells", level = 0 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "30+ new magic items, including popular mounts and companion creatures", level = 0 },
            { type = "list_item", text = "10+ professions", level = 0 },
            { type = "hr" },
            { type = "h2", text = "WHAT STORY WILL YOU TELL?" },
            { type = "p", text = "With D&D: World of Warcraft, you can write your own stories in the legendary world of Azeroth! Will you challenge the Lich King, rally your faction to war, or head out on an epic adventure the likes of which the world has never seen? The choice is yours!" },
            { type = "p", text = "It's time for your party to join the fray and blaze your own trail into Azeroth's history." },
            { type = "p", text = "* Requires a Battle.net account and an active World of Warcraft subscription and license to redeem the included in-game items. Not compatible with World of Warcraft Classic." },
            },
        },
        ["2026-08-08-stream-and-listen-to-the-world-of-warcraft-azeroth-housing-soundtrack-30e744a81b"] = {
            id = "2026-08-08-stream-and-listen-to-the-world-of-warcraft-azeroth-housing-soundtrack-30e744a81b",
            post_key = "30e744a81b",
            title = "Stream and Listen to the World of Warcraft: Azeroth Housing Soundtrack",
            category = "Blogs (EU)",
            timestamp = 1786185472,
            url = "https://news.blizzard.com/en-gb/article/24291433/stream-and-listen-to-the-world-of-warcraft-azeroth-housing-soundtrack",
            content = {
            { type = "p", text = "No matter which neighborhood you've chosen to call home, take the sounds of your corner of Azeroth with you wherever your journey leads." },
            { type = "hr" },
            { type = "h2", text = "ABOUT THE SOUNDTRACK" },
            { type = "image", width = 420, height = 420, u = 0.820312, v = 0.820312, file = "Interface\\AddOns\\BluePosts\\Media\\Posts\\2026-08-08-stream-and-listen-to-the-world-of-warcraft-azeroth-housing-soundtrack-30e744a81b\\image-1.jpg" },
            { type = "p", text = "The World of Warcraft: Azeroth Housing Soundtrack introduces an all-new collection of music created to bring Azeroth’s most personal spaces to life. The music supports player-driven spaces with compositions that emphasize warmth, atmosphere, and customization, shifting focus from large-scale adventure to personal expression. Each piece was crafted to complement the evolving nature of player housing, blending seamlessly with different environments and styles while staying grounded in the musical identity of Azeroth." },
