            { type = "p", text = "Temple of Sethraliss In Temple of Sethraliss, Adderis and Aspix now feature new overlaps that create additional positional challenges. Galvazzt now creates an additional Lightning Spire and has a more potent Consume Charge, increasing coordination difficulty. The Avatar of Sethraliss has less health, making class healing abilities more impactful, and we’ve adjusted the mechanics of Corrupted Lifeforce to add further coordination challenge. We’ve also removed some of the poison dispels found in the dungeon to alleviate issues with certain group compositions." },
